onfidence we'll be able to make Coastal a worthy experience on launch.The future will determine how much more content will come post-launch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T20:56:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378921","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4549920-1837955055356703","game_id":"steam-4549920","kind":"announcement","title":"Coastal Cargo New UI","summary":"Coastal Cargo -- Demo Preparation -- UIWork is progressing steadily to make a beautifully playable demo for you all to enjoy at Next Fest (hopefully earlier)One of the improvements is within the popup UI elements in the game, previously these were done through white text on see-through black squares. This new paper look should feel a whole lot better","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T12:23:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055356703","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4549920-1835236783564645","game_id":"steam-4549920","kind":"announcement","title":"Player Input Improvements -- Planning for Demo_localization","summary":"Working hard at improving the gameplay further for all you lovely people.Closed testing is going on and heavily requested and needed functions are being added.One of these is the following:To help players drop their boats properlyThey can now see which dock will be visited next!Other than that plans are being drawn up for what needs to be in the demo, soon we'll pivot towards preparing for that and getting a playable build out to all you lovely folkThanks for reading!Lot's of Love-SupremeCookie","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T20:26:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783564645","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4549920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4549920":"2026-10-26T12:52:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4549920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:24Z"},"5230040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:24Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4549920","app_id":4549920,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:40Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"6f1e96d4764f86cda6879a3f06898a4faf407ecc0d445bba837907ffc2a7cd25","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"‘Coastal Cargo’는 세계 최고의 해상 물류 전문가가 되는 것을 목표로 하는 전략 시뮬레이션 게임입니다. 광활한 군도 내 항구들 사이의 무역로를 개척하세요. 배를 배치하고 화물 운송을 시작해 보상을 획득하세요. 점점 더 어려워지는 이 환경에서 여러분의 제국은 얼마나 오래 버틸 수 있을까요?","publishers":[{"name":"DKat Games","creator_clan_account_id":46049471}],"developers":[{"name":"DKat Games","creator_clan_account_id":46049471}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Main Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1776192288","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4549920/1879069426/e1d330815264b3bcf93a5ed2eb4a062aa5a3bb8a/1774555373/m